      "review_description": "I was grateful for the extra quotes accessed through solarquotes.com.au - it saved me a lot of time trying to find a appropriate solar suppliers to quote.  Everyone responded quickly but it was a mixed bag of results - some followed through with what they said, others didn't and in the end it was quite difficult to get anyone to call me back when I requested more information.It was quite disconcerting that almost everybody had something different to recommend for our organisation - comparing quotes was a bit like comparing apples with oranges!Overall, I've found the solarquotes website and service very helpful but organising solar is definitely not a straightforward proposition!!",
